[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/163177052","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/471#issuecomment-163177052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/471","id":163177052,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2MzE3NzA1Mg==","user":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-02-04T23:15:25Z","updated_at":"2015-12-09T10:16:03Z","body":"_Original comment by_ **Claudiu Popa (BitBucket: [PCManticore](http://bitbucket.org/PCManticore), GitHub: @PCManticore)**:\n\n---\n\nLook all the methods from ancestors for too-few-public-methods.\n\nThis patch uses two counters for too-few-public-methods and too-many-public-methods.\nIn order to avoid false positives, too-many-public-methods check is looking\nonly for methods defined in the current class. On the other hand, too-few-public-methods\nshould look in ancestors as well, since most of the time this check is useful only\nfor simple classes, without many public methods.\nCloses issue #471.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"u